gmeow:CurationEpoch logic:subClassOf [ a logic:Restriction ; logic:onProperty gmeow:curationManifest ; logic:maxQualifiedCardinality 1 ; logic:onClass gmeow:InformationObject ] .
gmeow:CurationEpoch logic:subClassOf [ a logic:Restriction ; logic:onProperty gmeow:epochPredecessor ; logic:allValuesFrom gmeow:InformationObject ] .
